## License

MPHam-NextHam-test, MPHam-12K and MPHam-29K are released under the
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

MPHam-hard (its structures and the data computed on them) is released under the
[Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0)](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/):
488 of its 500 structures come from the GNoME batch of the Materials Project, which marks them `BY-NC`
(`builder_meta.license` in `structures/<id>/mp_record.json`). The pseudopotential and orbital files in its `dft_settings/`
keep the terms of their sources, listed in `dft_settings/README.md`.

The UniTB weights, their evaluation tables and the band-structure example are released under CC BY 4.0. The UniTB and
SO2CUDA source code in `UniTB.tar` is licensed under LGPL-3.0; third-party parts keep their own licenses, listed in
`UniTB/code/INSTALL.md`. The packed environment redistributes third-party packages unchanged under their own licenses,
listed in `UniTB/ENVIRONMENT.md`.

Please cite UniTB and NextHAM when you use the data, follow the Materials Project citation guidance for the structures,
and cite A. Merchant et al., Nature 624, 80 (2023) for the GNoME structures in MPHam-hard.

